OL,3,GNEWSAPolice chief constable recruitment
OL,4,Abrought forward
OL,5,
OL,6,FHernandez has now said the recruitment
OL,7,Fprocess of a substantive chief
OL,8,Fconstable, which was planned for 2028,
OL,9,Fwould begin at the end of November, a
OL,10,Fmove welcomed by CPOSA.
OL,12,FShe said: "I acknowledge this is a
OL,13,Flegitimate challenge to a decision that
OL,14,Fwas made in good faith."
